00:43:17,156 --> 00:43:18,845
Serves you right!

572
00:43:41,932 --> 00:43:43,163
Give it up.

573
00:43:43,163 --> 00:43:46,646
Soo would never fall for a guy like you.

574
00:43:46,646 --> 00:43:49,245
Soo is my friend.

575
00:43:53,597 --> 00:43:57,806
Soo must have hated it so much
she ran out of the club!

576
00:44:12,002 --> 00:44:16,715
♪ Rainy mornings always... ♪

577
00:44:19,635 --> 00:44:21,355
Darn it.

578
00:44:21,355 --> 00:44:23,231
That scared me!

579
00:44:28,520 --> 00:44:30,765
What's with this guy?

580
00:44:30,765 --> 00:44:34,293
Who tries to pick up women here this early?

581
00:44:35,317 --> 00:44:37,745
What are you doing here?

582
00:44:39,613 --> 00:44:40,673
Coincidence?

583
00:44:40,673 --> 00:44:44,159
Then coincidences like this should be a crime.

584
00:44:44,159 --> 00:44:46,453
Dressed this boringly...

585
00:44:46,453 --> 00:44:48,080
Interview?

586
00:44:48,080 --> 00:44:49,373
So what?

587
00:44:49,373 --> 00:44:53,212
You think I'm out of options
just because you rejected me?

588
00:45:00,605 --> 00:45:02,344
Go away! Get lost!

589
00:45:02,344 --> 00:45:05,118
You're bad luck!

590
00:45:06,181 --> 00:45:08,727
You'd refuse a ride anyway.

591
00:45:14,568 --> 00:45:17,421
You think that will break it?

592
00:45:18,048 --> 00:45:19,769
You're all noise.

593
00:45:19,769 --> 00:45:22,239
You can't do anything right.

594
00:45:22,239 --> 00:45:24,431
What's wrong with this guy?

595
00:45:24,431 --> 00:45:26,327
Why does he keep showing up

596
00:45:26,327 --> 00:45:28,874
just to rub salt in the wound?

597
00:45:28,874 --> 00:45:31,707
What is your problem with me?

598
00:45:31,707 --> 00:45:34,543
I'll give you three reasons. Pick one.

599
00:45:34,543 --> 00:45:35,878
First.

600
00:45:35,878 --> 00:45:37,171
Because you're pretty.

601
00:45:37,171 --> 00:45:39,298
Just like that?

602
00:45:39,298 --> 00:45:41,408
No. Don't fall for it.

603
00:45:41,408 --> 00:45:42,602
There are two more.

604
00:45:42,602 --> 00:45:44,011
Second.

605
00:45:44,011 --> 00:45:46,634
Because I've fallen for you.

606
00:45:46,634 --> 00:45:47,806
What?

607
00:45:47,806 --> 00:45:50,239
Is this his way of confessing?

608
00:45:50,239 --> 00:45:51,352
No.

609
00:45:51,352 --> 00:45:53,008
There's still one more.

610
00:45:53,008 --> 00:45:56,152
Hear the man out
before you jump to conclusions.

611
00:45:56,152 --> 00:45:57,191
And third.

612
00:45:57,191 --> 00:45:59,624
Could it be...

613
00:46:04,706 --> 00:46:07,993
Because you lied to me.

614
00:46:07,993 --> 00:46:09,981
That's it?

615
00:46:12,482 --> 00:46:16,274
You really know how to hold a grudge.

616
00:46:16,274 --> 00:46:17,309
Fine.

617
00:46:17,309 --> 00:46:19,582
I pretended to be a doctor once.

618
00:46:19,582 --> 00:46:23,328
But you ruined my interview, so we're even.

619
00:46:23,328 --> 00:46:27,851
And do you stalk and harass
everyone who lies to you?

620
00:46:27,851 --> 00:46:31,299
Must be nice having so much free time!

621
00:46:31,299 --> 00:46:35,092
That's the first time anyone's called me idle.

622
00:46:38,455 --> 00:46:40,302
See you again.

623
00:46:44,028 --> 00:46:45,548
What's his deal?

624
00:46:45,548 --> 00:46:49,341
He stops me, gets me all worked up,
then drives off?

625
00:46:50,554 --> 00:46:51,870
Hey!

626
00:46:51,870 --> 00:46:54,408
Stay out of my sight!

627
00:47:00,051 --> 00:47:01,076
Hey.

628
00:47:01,076 --> 00:47:03,132
You see Lee Eun Chae, right?

629
00:47:03,132 --> 00:47:04,818
"Lee Eun Chae?"

630
00:47:04,818 --> 00:47:07,176
She's my sister-in-law.

631
00:47:07,176 --> 00:47:08,415
"Sister-in-law?"

632
00:47:09,388 --> 00:47:11,348
Your sister-in-law...

633
00:47:11,954 --> 00:47:15,014
Oh, she stopped by before you got there.

634
00:47:15,014 --> 00:47:16,865
So you two met?

635
00:47:16,865 --> 00:47:18,188
Well...

636
00:47:18,188 --> 00:47:20,154
Your sister-in-law...

637
00:47:20,154 --> 00:47:21,522
What's her job?

638
00:47:21,522 --> 00:47:23,662
She looks unemployed.

639
00:47:23,662 --> 00:47:24,994
What?

640
00:47:24,994 --> 00:47:26,773
She works at Taeyun Group.

641
00:47:26,773 --> 00:47:28,312
"Taeyun Group?"

642
00:47:28,312 --> 00:47:29,351
Yeah.

643
00:47:29,351 --> 00:47:31,454
She's still an intern,

644
00:47:31,454 --> 00:47:33,126
but it's been a month already.

645
00:47:34,738 --> 00:47:36,025
Wait.

646
00:47:36,832 --> 00:47:39,683
Are you interested in her?

647
00:47:39,683 --> 00:47:41,832
No, that's not it.

648
00:47:41,832 --> 00:47:43,630
She got a job?

649
00:47:43,630 --> 00:47:45,822
At Taeyun Group, of all places?

650
00:47:47,009 --> 00:47:49,117
Okay, I'll call you later.

651
00:47:49,117 --> 00:47:50,118
Bye.

652
00:47:54,850 --> 00:47:58,556
She has a job, but she's going to interviews?

653
00:47:59,690 --> 00:48:02,301
Our background check shows Lee Eun Chae is

654
00:48:02,301 --> 00:48:06,338
a contract call center worker
at Taeyun Home Shopping.

655
00:48:06,338 --> 00:48:07,783
Understood.

656
00:48:11,950 --> 00:48:14,158
Lee Eun Chae...

657
00:48:14,158 --> 00:48:16,545
What's your story?

658
00:48:16,545 --> 00:48:18,373
Yes, sir.

659
00:48:18,373 --> 00:48:20,709
Could you repeat that?

660
00:48:20,709 --> 00:48:23,754
I bought a car seat,

661
00:48:23,754 --> 00:48:26,667
and I want to know if fart smells stick to it.

662
00:48:27,618 --> 00:48:30,698
What kind of question is that?

663
00:48:32,571 --> 00:48:36,517
You're asking if the seat
traps the smell of farts?

664
00:48:36,517 --> 00:48:38,011
I need to know

665
00:48:38,011 --> 00:48:40,808
whether I can fart while driving

666
00:48:40,808 --> 00:48:42,564
before I decide.

667
00:48:42,564 --> 00:48:46,614
If you're worried about the smell, don't fart!

668
00:48:46,614 --> 00:48:48,138
May I have your name?

669
00:48:48,138 --> 00:48:51,754
I'll check whether your car seat
has odor-resistant features.

670
00:48:51,754 --> 00:48:53,186
Let me check.

671
00:48:53,186 --> 00:48:55,452
My name?

672
00:48:55,452 --> 00:48:57,370
Kim Bait.

673
00:48:57,370 --> 00:48:59,370
"Kim Bait?"

674
00:48:59,370 --> 00:49:00,415
Now, tell me,

675
00:49:00,415 --> 00:49:03,502
would you fart or hold it in?

676
00:49:03,502 --> 00:49:04,586
Is that Kim Bait?

677
00:49:04,586 --> 00:49:06,380
I can't find your name.

678
00:49:06,380 --> 00:49:07,606
I'm asking you!

679
00:49:07,606 --> 00:49:10,180
Fart or hold it in?

680
00:49:12,094 --> 00:49:13,704
Kim Bait?

681
00:49:15,339 --> 00:49:18,406
I took the bait.

682
00:49:18,406 --> 00:49:19,768
Sir,

683
00:49:19,768 --> 00:49:22,605
you can't make prank calls here.

684
00:49:22,605 --> 00:49:25,178
You fall for it every time.

685
00:49:26,893 --> 00:49:28,694
It's him!

686
00:49:28,694 --> 00:49:32,800
The guy who asked why
his cereal didn't make him strong like a tiger

687
00:49:32,800 --> 00:49:34,806
and wouldn't let it go.

688
00:49:37,532 --> 00:49:41,837
Can't you go one day without causing trouble?

689
00:49:41,837 --> 00:49:43,444
You called the cops?

690
00:49:43,444 --> 00:49:46,128
What are we supposed to do with you?

691
00:49:46,128 --> 00:49:48,797
He's a serial prank caller.

692
00:49:48,797 --> 00:49:51,508
That's why I reported him.

693
00:49:51,508 --> 00:49:54,254
The emergency line isn't
for reporting prank calls.

694
00:49:54,254 --> 00:49:58,400
So you basically made a prank call yourself!

695
00:49:58,400 --> 00:50:02,294
If you keep causing trouble,
find yourself another job.

696
00:50:02,294 --> 00:50:04,092
That's enough!

697
00:50:04,092 --> 00:50:05,804
Oh, sir...

698
00:50:05,804 --> 00:50:07,232
Team Leader Yeo.

699
00:50:07,232 --> 00:50:08,695
She's new.

700
00:50:08,695 --> 00:50:11,019
People make mistakes.

701
00:50:11,019 --> 00:50:12,664
But, sir...

702
00:50:12,664 --> 00:50:14,364
Team Leader Yeo!

703
00:50:14,364 --> 00:50:16,215
You never messed up as a rookie?

704
00:50:16,215 --> 00:50:20,412
Why bring up ancient history?

705
00:50:20,412 --> 00:50:23,498
Don't take it too hard.

706
00:50:23,498 --> 00:50:25,334
Thank you.

707
00:50:25,334 --> 00:50:27,120
You're a pretty girl.

708
00:50:27,120 --> 00:50:28,785
Maybe...

709
00:50:28,785 --> 00:50:32,911
you should try hosting on home shopping.

710
00:50:32,911 --> 00:50:36,625
What a sleazy bastard!

711
00:50:44,205 --> 00:50:45,279
Oh, my...

712
00:50:46,272 --> 00:50:48,607
My father always told me

713
00:50:48,607 --> 00:50:52,598
everyone has to earn their keep.

714
00:50:52,598 --> 00:50:54,363
And another thing!

715
00:50:54,363 --> 00:50:56,156
When you meet a scumbag,

716
00:50:56,156 --> 00:50:58,033
you teach him a lesson

717
00:50:58,033 --> 00:51:00,743
so he never does it again!

718
00:51:02,029 --> 00:51:04,326
Who the hell are you?

719
00:51:04,326 --> 00:51:05,874
Are you insane?

720
00:51:05,874 --> 00:51:09,556
You grabbed my butt first, you bastard!

721
00:51:11,116 --> 00:51:13,073
You saw that, right?

722
00:51:13,073 --> 00:51:15,181
Well... No!

723
00:51:15,181 --> 00:51:18,011
I didn't see anything!

724
00:51:18,011 --> 00:51:20,651
Wow, I almost bought that.

725
00:51:40,993 --> 00:51:42,285
[Yeo Si Hyeon, Team Leader]
Lee Eun Chae.

726
00:51:42,285 --> 00:51:44,871
He's pressing assault charges.

727
00:51:44,871 --> 00:51:49,251
He'll settle for ten million won.
Wouldn't that be easier?

728
00:52:01,506 --> 00:52:04,015
Tell him I'll countersue.

729
00:52:04,015 --> 00:52:06,012
Team Leader Yeo.

730
00:52:06,550 --> 00:52:08,353
You should be ashamed of yourself.

731
00:52:08,353 --> 00:52:10,832
What? Watch your mouth!

732
00:52:18,181 --> 00:52:20,208
[Attorney Kim Se Hoon's Office]
[Certified Labor Consultant's Office]

733
00:52:22,909 --> 00:52:25,251
No cameras, no witnesses.

734
00:52:25,251 --> 00:52:26,788
You're at a serious disadvantage.

735
00:52:26,788 --> 00:52:29,708
If you lose, you'll also pay their legal fees.

736
00:52:29,708 --> 00:52:31,749
Still want to fight?

737
00:52:32,419 --> 00:52:33,948
Hey.

738
00:52:33,948 --> 00:52:36,585
Think of it as stepping in crap.

739
00:52:38,633 --> 00:52:41,098
I didn't just step in it.

740
00:52:41,098 --> 00:52:43,930
Someone shoved me down right into the pile.

741
00:52:43,930 --> 00:52:45,979
Nice punch, though.

742
00:52:45,979 --> 00:52:51,032
I'll take a heroine who fights back
over a helpless K-drama lead.

743
00:52:51,032 --> 00:52:52,171
Right?

744
00:52:52,171 --> 00:52:54,024
Yeah, me too.

745
00:52:54,024 --> 00:52:58,042
Except in real life,
I'm getting sued for assault.

746
00:52:58,042 --> 00:52:59,090
What?

747
00:52:59,090 --> 00:53:00,238
He's the one at fault.

748
00:53:00,238 --> 00:53:01,663
And he's suing you?

749
00:53:01,663 --> 00:53:05,414
If I can't find ten million won
and Dad will find out.

750
00:53:05,414 --> 00:53:07,989
What am I going to do?

751
00:53:08,602 --> 00:53:10,133
"Ten million won?"

752
00:53:10,133 --> 00:53:12,501
Shouldn't you tell your father?

753
00:53:12,501 --> 00:53:14,421
No way.

754
00:53:14,421 --> 00:53:16,293
I've already lied about my job.

755
00:53:16,293 --> 00:53:18,611
If he finds out I was sexually harassed,

756
00:53:18,611 --> 00:53:20,286
he'll hunt that manager down

757
00:53:20,286 --> 00:53:23,361
and rip every hair out of his head.

758
00:53:23,361 --> 00:53:25,597
Could you ask your brother-in-law for help?

759
00:53:25,597 --> 00:53:28,503
He lives on an allowance from my sister.

760
00:53:29,309 --> 00:53:30,923
Then...

761
00:53:31,436 --> 00:53:33,319
Let's pool our money.

762
00:53:40,951 --> 00:53:41,982
Forget it.

763
00:53:41,982 --> 00:53:44,982
You guys don't have any money.

764
00:53:44,982 --> 00:53:46,437
Okay!

765
00:53:47,911 --> 00:53:50,277
Let's bring the house down tonight

766
00:53:52,332 --> 00:53:53,959
and sell every last CD.

767
00:53:53,959 --> 00:53:55,168
Come on, huddle up!

768
00:53:55,168 --> 00:53:56,269
- We can do this.
- Hands in!

769
00:53:56,269 --> 00:53:57,854
- Let's go!
- India!

770
00:53:57,854 --> 00:53:59,508
- Red!
- Red!

771
00:53:59,508 --> 00:54:01,716
Shouldn't our hands go down?

772
00:54:01,716 --> 00:54:02,764
Let's do this.

773
00:54:36,839 --> 00:54:38,492
Eun Chae!

774
00:54:39,004 --> 00:54:40,630
We sold all our CDs!

775
00:54:40,630 --> 00:54:42,202
No way.

776
00:54:42,202 --> 00:54:43,216
I'm serious!

777
00:54:43,216 --> 00:54:44,743
Hey, Eun Chae.

778
00:54:44,743 --> 00:54:46,383
We can do this.

779
00:54:46,383 --> 00:54:48,597
At this rate, we can cover the settlement.

780
00:54:48,597 --> 00:54:49,931
Well, except...

781
00:54:49,931 --> 00:54:51,591
We still need to sell 900 more.

782
00:54:51,591 --> 00:54:54,812
A real superfan! He bought every CD at once.

783
00:54:54,812 --> 00:54:56,810
Wait, seriously?

784
00:54:57,368 --> 00:54:58,989
Just a second.

785
00:54:58,989 --> 00:55:02,275
The customer wants a photo with us,
I invited him.

786
00:55:02,275 --> 00:55:03,368
- Is that okay?
- Yeah.

787
00:55:03,368 --> 00:55:05,280
Thank God I didn't take my makeup off.

788
00:55:05,280 --> 00:55:06,768
Good.

789
00:55:09,098 --> 00:55:11,025
Come on in.

790
00:55:12,829 --> 00:55:14,845
Could we take a picture?

791
00:55:14,845 --> 00:55:15,897
Two, three!

792
00:55:15,897 --> 00:55:18,027
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

793
00:55:18,027 --> 00:55:20,005
Oh, I'm just the messenger.

794
00:55:20,005 --> 00:55:22,880
The person who bought them is...

795
00:55:30,255 --> 00:55:31,725
He is...

796
00:55:35,163 --> 00:55:36,186
He's that...

797
00:55:36,186 --> 00:55:38,690
sex addict...

798
00:55:48,638 --> 00:55:50,992
If this is about meeting Soo,

799
00:55:50,992 --> 00:55:52,619
I'll give you your money back.

800
00:55:52,619 --> 00:55:54,454
No, please.

801
00:55:54,454 --> 00:55:56,623
I think we had a misunderstanding,

802
00:55:56,623 --> 00:55:59,323
so I came to apologize.

803
00:56:08,259 --> 00:56:10,225
I'm sorry.

804
00:56:11,443 --> 00:56:14,743
I'll keep rooting for you.

805
00:56:21,191 --> 00:56:24,864
I heard you're friends with Lee Eun Chae.

806
00:56:25,860 --> 00:56:27,821
Give her a message for me.

807
00:56:27,821 --> 00:56:29,389
I'm going to...

808
00:56:29,389 --> 00:56:32,169
sue Seo Jin Woo.

809
00:56:58,093 --> 00:56:59,102
Don't fight.

810
00:56:59,102 --> 00:57:00,395
Three months, starting now.

811
00:57:00,395 --> 00:57:01,642
Come work as my secretary.

812
00:57:01,642 --> 00:57:04,802
I'm sure you'll fall for me too.

813
00:57:04,802 --> 00:57:06,750
Five degrees warmer.

814
00:57:06,750 --> 00:57:10,028
Leaving without my permission
is a breach of contract.

815
00:57:10,028 --> 00:57:10,905
The penalty is...

816
00:57:10,905 --> 00:57:12,001
Three times?

817
00:57:12,001 --> 00:57:14,576
What kind of devil is this guy?

818
00:57:14,576 --> 00:57:15,702
Already smitten?

819
00:57:15,702 --> 00:57:17,426
Don't panic, Eun Chae.

820
00:57:17,426 --> 00:57:18,371
I'll be there!

821
00:57:18,371 --> 00:57:19,581
No matter what.

822
00:57:19,581 --> 00:57:21,750
You're quite the habitual liar.

823
00:57:21,750 --> 00:57:23,793
Is he watching something dirty?

824
00:57:23,793 --> 00:57:25,906
Why is my heart pounding?
